    next: climbs_when(capability: "PR 4/5 consumes the committed attempt with full grant and lease binding, demonstrates duplicate delivery cannot duplicate execution, and reconciles launch-before-transfer and cancellation without a second live attempt. PR 5's receipt binds WorkOutcome and the legacy producer is migrated. PR 3 names missing outcome/work/source and refuses legacy-shaped receipts; it never fabricates an outcome. PR 6 connects the route to local consumers."),
